[[File:Snowstorm Bundle.png|thumb|200px]]
[[Snowstorm Bundle]] is the annual limited time offer for the [[Christmas Event 2025]]. Purchasing the whole bundle costs 3,399 Robux, which gives players the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife [[Snowstorm]], the godly gun [[Blizzard]], and the bundle-exclusive [[Snowstorm (Effect)|Snowstorm]] effect. This year, seperate gamepasses for the weapons were not introduced so players must buy the bundle, there is also a chance that players will receive the weapons' chroma counterparts: [[Chroma Snowstorm]] and [[Chroma Blizzard]] for the first time.

